+---
+id: task-003-validate-task-input
+type: task
+title: "Validate task input"
+status: approved
+format: 1
+---
+
+Reject invalid input with an `invalid-input` error whose message says what is wrong, and change nothing
+in the list when input is rejected. Applies when a task is added, renamed or tagged:
+
+- a title that is empty or only spaces;
+- a title longer than 120 characters (after trimming);
+- a priority other than `low`, `normal` and `high`;
+- a tag that is empty or contains a space (checked for the tags of a new task and for `tag`).
+
+Failures are `Result` values (rule r4); the new code `invalid-input` is added to `TodoErrorCode`.
